    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13294" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπόνηρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πονηρός</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>not vicious, harmless,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				163
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Medic.,
				<i>not malignant,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρετοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antyll.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				5.29.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόνηρος</span>) <i>not taking pains,</i> c.
				inf., <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Lys.</u>
				15
			</span></i>.</div>
